# nodes=6
# Two disjoint K3 cliques (no inter-clique edges). Tests the
# disconnected-graph invariant per spec.md Edge Cases "Disconnected
# graph": every weakly-connected component MUST receive at least one
# community, no community may span the two components.
#   Clique A: nodes 0, 1, 2 (3 edges)
#   Clique B: nodes 3, 4, 5 (3 edges)
#   Total: 6 edges.
0	1	1.0
0	2	1.0
1	2	1.0
3	4	1.0
3	5	1.0
4	5	1.0